            "text": "<p>From order to delivery, here’s what to expect:</p><h3>Express Shipping</h3><p>Express Shipping is the simpler option. Your order is usually dispatched within <strong>2–3 business days</strong>, and we’ll send your shipping details as soon as it’s on the way.</p><h3>Standard Shipping</h3><ul><li><strong>1–2 weeks:</strong> Order processing, production & dispatch<br/></li><li><strong>4–5 weeks after dispatch:</strong> Reminder email with ETA & delivery instructions<br/></li><li><strong>5–10 weeks depending on country:</strong> Local delivery, kerbside only. The driver will contact you via phone or email before delivery.<br/></li></ul>",
