          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>After production, we arrange international shipping based on your delivery address.</p><p><strong>Estimated delivery times range from 3 to 9 weeks</strong>, depending on your location.</p><p>Please refer to the timeline below to estimate the shipping time to your region.</p><ul><li><strong>Americas(4-8 weeks): </strong>United States, Canada, Mexico</li><li><strong>Asia(2-3 weeks): </strong>Japan, South Korea, Singapore </li><li><strong>Europe(6-8 weeks): </strong>Austria,<strong> </strong>Belgium, France, Germany, Italy, Netherlands, Poland, Spain, Sweden, United Kingdom</li><li><strong>Middle East(6-8 weeks)</strong>: Saudi Arabia, United Arab Emirates</li><li><strong>Oceania(8-10 weeks): </strong>New Zealand</li></ul>",
