        "text_iQdCYg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Delivery method depends on the size and specification of your sofa.</p><p>Larger furniture orders may be delivered by a specialist furniture delivery partner, who will contact you by email or phone to arrange a delivery time.</p><p>Carton-packed orders may be sent with a courier such as DPD, DHL, or a similar service. Tracking details will be shared once your order is on the way.</p><p>Delivery is <strong>kerbside only</strong>. Our default delivery option is kerbside only and does not include in-home delivery, assembly, or packaging removal. For any additional delivery requests, please contact us in advance at support@ozroomy.com.</p>",
